    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP on two strings</span><span class=\"chip accent\">LCS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-common-subsequence/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1143</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Longest Common Subsequence</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Compare the last letters of two prefixes. Equal: the LCS grows by one from both shorter prefixes (diagonal + 1). Different: drop one of them and take the better (max of up, left). An (m+1) × (n+1) table, O(m·n) time; one row plus a saved diagonal cuts space to O(min(m, n)).</p>\n"
